<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><font color="#fff4f2">one more time</font></font></font></b></font>

31
00:01:35,150 --> 00:01:38,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke's movements have stopped!
There's still quite a bit of distance, though...</font>

32
00:01:41,160 --> 00:01:43,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So Sasuke caught up to him, huh?</font>

33
00:01:44,540 --> 00:01:45,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

34
00:01:45,830 --> 00:01:48,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? This smell is...?!</font>

35
00:01:50,380 --> 00:01:52,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's wrong?!</font>

36
00:01:52,960 --> 00:01:54,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did something happen to Sasuke-kun?!</font>

37
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:57,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't notice until now.</font>

38
00:01:59,220 --> 00:02:00,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You...</font>

39
00:02:01,180 --> 00:02:03,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">use the same shampoo as me.</font>

40
00:02:07,020 --> 00:02:11,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This floral green fragrance...
No doubt!</font>

41
00:02:11,270 --> 00:02:13,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Hey now...!</font>

42
00:02:13,570 --> 00:02:16,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... my coat's shinier.</font>

43
00:02:16,940 --> 00:02:20,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be saying stupid things
at such an important time!</font>

44
00:02:20,820 --> 00:02:22,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— I'm the same as a dog?
— Sorry, sorry...</font>

45
00:02:23,790 --> 00:02:26,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Same as a dog... Same as a dog...</font>

46
00:02:26,700 --> 00:02:28,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Hey, Sakura-chan?
— Same as a dog...</font>

47
00:02:29,170 --> 00:02:30,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Same as a dog...</font>

48
00:02:31,330 --> 00:02:34,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Same as a dog... Same as a dog...</font>

49
00:02:35,090 --> 00:02:37,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Sakura-chan...!
Wait!</font>

50
00:02:38,130 --> 00:02:41,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! Hey! Don't go ahead of me!</font>

51
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:46,680
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Hokage's Mistake</font>

52
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:46,680
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The True Face</font>

53
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:46,680
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Under the Mask</font>

54
00:02:49,690 --> 00:02:50,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

55
00:02:52,020 --> 00:02:53,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uchiha Sasuke!</font>

56
00:02:56,230 --> 00:02:58,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you get away now!</font>

57
00:03:00,110 --> 00:03:04,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez, this kid of all people...
at a time when Gaara is like this.</font>

58
00:03:04,660 --> 00:03:06,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man, this is bad.</font>

59
00:03:09,790 --> 00:03:11,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh! That's fine.</font>

60
00:03:13,130 --> 00:03:15,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kankuro! Take Gaara and go quickly!</font>

61
00:03:20,550 --> 00:03:22,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave him to me!</font>

62
00:03:23,390 --> 00:03:24,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Temari...!</font>

63
00:03:25,260 --> 00:03:27,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter how you look at it,
you can't beat him alone!</font>

64
00:03:27,890 --> 00:03:28,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave me be!</font>

65
00:03:29,060 --> 00:03:31,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is an important mission for
the Village Hidden in the Sand!</font>

66
00:03:31,850 --> 00:03:33,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Make Gaara the first priority!</font>

67
00:03:34,860 --> 00:03:38,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Besides, he's quite my type of a guy...</font>

68
00:03:40,070 --> 00:03:41,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go! Kankuro!</font>

69
00:03:43,320 --> 00:03:44,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't think so!</font>

70
00:03:46,780 --> 00:03:47,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you get away!</font>

71
00:03:51,580 --> 00:03:52,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eat this!</font>

72
00:03:59,050 --> 00:04:00,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My opponent is that Uchiha kid...</font>

73
00:04:01,420 --> 00:04:05,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is not good. I only have
a bit of Chakra left.</font>

74
00:04:08,890 --> 00:04:12,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll stand even less of a chance
if he uses his Sharingan here...</font>

75
00:04:13,640 --> 00:04:17,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I need to get him to use
a large amount of Chakra at any cost.</font>

76
00:04:18,570 --> 00:04:21,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shall I take care of her in
one hit with Chidori? Or...</font>

77
00:04:23,150 --> 00:04:24,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In this situation, maybe I should...</font>

78
00:04:39,170 --> 00:04:43,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As I thought... He's trying to save
some Chakra for Gaara.</font>

79
00:04:45,220 --> 00:04:46,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Wind Scythe Jutsu!</font>

80
00:04:58,360 --> 00:04:59,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't underestimate me!</font>

81
00:04:59,570 --> 00:05:01,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Sand Storm!</font>

82
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:14,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! I have to do something about
that bothersome fan...</font>

83
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:20,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph... I wonder how long
you'll last with such a way of fighting.</font>

84
00:05:21,550 --> 00:05:22,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be helped...</font>

85
00:05:28,180 --> 00:05:30,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like you've finally
gotten serious, eh?</font>

86
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:35,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fire Style: Phoenix Flower Jutsu!</font>

87
00:05:36,640 --> 00:05:38,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the stuff!</font>

88
00:05:51,030 --> 00:05:52,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aim with precision!</font>

89
00:05:53,580 --> 00:05:55,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fire Style: Fireball Jutsu!</font>

90
00:05:58,880 --> 00:05:59,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did I get her?</font>

91
00:06:02,590 --> 00:06:03,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wind Scythe Jutsu!</font>

92
00:06:05,970 --> 00:06:07,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've got you.</font>

93
00:06:08,590 --> 00:06:09,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh no!</font>

94
00:06:09,760 --> 00:06:10,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now!</font>

95
00:06:14,310 --> 00:06:15,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're mine!</font>

96
00:06:22,900 --> 00:06:23,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good!</font>

97
00:06:26,110 --> 00:06:28,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What?! Substitution?!</font>

98
00:06:31,910 --> 00:06:32,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh no!</font>

99
00:06:47,590 --> 00:06:51,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry, but I don't have the time
to be dealing with you forever!</font>

100
00:07:04,020 --> 00:07:08,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">D-Damn it...
G-Gaara, at any cost...</font>

101
00:07:15,740 --> 00:07:17,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's that?!</font>

102
00:07:17,580 --> 00:07:19,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the hell is going on?</font>

103
00:07:21,170 --> 00:07:23,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who the hell is that youth?</font>

104
00:07:25,630 --> 00:07:27,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who on earth are you?!</font>

105
00:07:28,970 --> 00:07:32,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it so sudden you can't tell?</font>

106
00:07:32,720 --> 00:07:35,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's me. Orochimaru.</font>

107
00:07:37,720 --> 00:07:42,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be... Have you completed
that Forbidden Jutsu?</font>

108
00:07:48,190 --> 00:07:52,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I struggled for decades...
after leaving the village.</font>

109
00:07:52,820 --> 00:07:55,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're a truly frightening,
inhuman monster!</font>

110
00:08:05,880 --> 00:08:07,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, he did it, huh...?</font>

111
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:12,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The reason I couldn't select you
to be the Fourth Hokage...</font>

112
00:08:13,090 --> 00:08:15,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is because of that distorted
consciousness.</font>

113
00:08:59,260 --> 00:09:01,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've finally been found out, eh...?</font>

114
00:09:05,060 --> 00:09:06,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's too bad.</font>

115
00:09:06,690 --> 00:09:10,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru...
What's the meaning of this?!</font>

116
00:09:11,150 --> 00:09:14,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I'd set that
many booby traps...</font>

117
00:09:16,360 --> 00:09:18,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so I was quite surprised.</font>

118
00:09:18,870 --> 00:09:21,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I see... So it was you.</font>

119
00:09:22,450 --> 00:09:25,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Recently, there has been a steady stream
of people going missing from the village,</font>

120
00:09:25,920 --> 00:09:28,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from Genin to Chunin,
and even ANBU Black Ops members.</font>

121
00:09:28,750 --> 00:09:33,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There was also information that
you had been acting strange...</font>

122
00:09:33,920 --> 00:09:35,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru-sama...</font>

123
00:09:35,220 --> 00:09:37,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why did a Shinobi of your rank
do such a thing?</font>

124
00:09:39,390 --> 00:09:41,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shall I kill you, too?</font>

125
00:09:43,220 --> 00:09:47,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru! Sure enough,
this was your doing...?</font>

126
00:09:48,020 --> 00:09:50,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say it! What were you doing here?!</font>

127
00:09:51,020 --> 00:09:54,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Alas! I've been found out.</font>

128
00:09:54,110 --> 00:09:56,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no point in acting cute...</font>

129
00:09:58,160 --> 00:10:01,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's for Jutsu development!</font>

130
00:10:01,990 --> 00:10:03,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochi... You bastard!</font>

131
00:10:03,740 --> 00:10:05,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For that purpose, you did this
to fellow Shinobi...?!</font>

132
00:10:06,750 --> 00:10:08,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As I thought, Forbidden Jutsu, eh...</font>

133
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:13,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it that you want?</font>

134
00:10:14,260 --> 00:10:15,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want everything!</font>

135
00:10:16,670 --> 00:10:18,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everything, you say?!</font>

136
00:10:25,680 --> 00:10:31,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get every Jutsu and understand
all of the truths of this world!</font>

137
00:10:31,980 --> 00:10:34,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The one who first mixed
blue and yellow</font>

138
00:10:35,110 --> 00:10:38,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">named the new color made
in that way, green.</font>

139
00:10:39,860 --> 00:10:42,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I just want to do the same thing.</font>

140
00:10:43,830 --> 00:10:46,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If blue is Chakra, yellow is a Sign...</font>

141
00:10:46,370 --> 00:10:48,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and green is a Jutsu.</font>

142
00:10:48,790 --> 00:10:52,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the same way that there
are no limits to the kinds of colors,</font>

143
00:10:52,420 --> 00:10:56,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there are probably also tens
of thousands of Jutsu in this world...</font>

144
00:10:56,590 --> 00:11:00,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But in order to get any
and all of the Jutsu...</font>

145
00:11:00,430 --> 00:11:05,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as well as the truths,
a long time is necessary.</font>

146
00:11:06,720 --> 00:11:11,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the one who takes those
long years to know everything,</font>

147
00:11:12,020 --> 00:11:15,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who can suitably be called
the ultimate individual.</font>

148
00:11:17,150 --> 00:11:21,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For me, the life span of
the body is too short.</font>

149
00:11:21,530 --> 00:11:22,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Too fleeting.</font>

150
00:11:24,200 --> 00:11:30,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if I were to be called the Hokage,
if I die, it all ends there.</font>

151
00:11:30,460 --> 00:11:35,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru... Could it be that
the Jutsu you're testing here is...</font>

152
00:11:35,420 --> 00:11:38,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right... It sure could be...</font>

153
00:11:47,510 --> 00:11:50,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Immortality Jutsu!</font>

154
00:11:59,860 --> 00:12:01,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Immortality Jutsu is a technique of</font>

155
00:12:01,740 --> 00:12:05,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">eternally pooling one's own
spirits into this earth...</font>

156
00:12:06,120 --> 00:12:09,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words,
it's a Revival Jutsu where...</font>

157
00:12:10,120 --> 00:12:15,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you find a new body, put your own spirit
into that body and take it over.</font>

158
00:12:20,010 --> 00:12:23,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I assumed my old form until now,</font>

159
00:12:23,800 --> 00:12:28,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so that you would feel nostalgic
about our reunion...</font>

160
00:12:30,020 --> 00:12:33,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aging is an empty thing, isn't it?</font>

161
00:12:33,890 --> 00:12:37,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I feel that keenly when I look at you.</font>

162
00:12:39,020 --> 00:12:41,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll die here...</font>

163
00:12:41,360 --> 00:12:46,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and I'll get a younger,
more beautiful and stronger body...</font>

164
00:12:47,530 --> 00:12:51,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Leaf truly lets me have my fill of fun...</font>

165
00:12:57,960 --> 00:13:01,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I get it...
You want Uchiha Sasuke, eh?!</font>

166
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:15,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right... Exactly... Sasuke-kun.</font>

167
00:13:16,440 --> 00:13:18,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Reviving Jutsu where
someone else's body is stolen</font>

168
00:13:18,770 --> 00:13:21,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the spirit is immortalized, huh?</font>

169
00:13:22,440 --> 00:13:26,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How many faces and bodies
have you gone through?!</font>

170
00:13:27,490 --> 00:13:30,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Two, I think...</font>

171
00:13:30,490 --> 00:13:35,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I plan to take Sasuke-kun over after
raising him a little more to my liking.</font>

172
00:13:39,920 --> 00:13:43,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But after all, in order to make you regret
your very own life...</font>

173
00:13:43,710 --> 00:13:46,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and curse destiny as you die...</font>

174
00:13:47,930 --> 00:13:51,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...perhaps this face is better?</font>

175
00:13:54,020 --> 00:13:55,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You monster!</font>

176
00:14:07,740 --> 00:14:08,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokage-sama!</font>

177
00:14:13,950 --> 00:14:20,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't lower your guard, Sensei!
You're always too soft...</font>

178
00:14:27,510 --> 00:14:30,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's been wrong with you?
This isn't like you!</font>

179
00:14:30,640 --> 00:14:31,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry...</font>

180
00:15:04,800 --> 00:15:05,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eyes...</font>

181
00:15:06,880 --> 00:15:09,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eyes with malice and ambition
concealed in them...</font>

182
00:15:10,050 --> 00:15:13,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I had noticed that
you had such tendencies.</font>

183
00:15:14,640 --> 00:15:17,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I had noticed,
but pretended not to know.</font>

184
00:15:18,930 --> 00:15:21,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was still during the war-torn era.</font>

185
00:15:21,520 --> 00:15:24,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A genius who brimmed
over strongly with ability...</font>

186
00:15:24,270 --> 00:15:28,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nothing less than a phenomenon
that comes once in several decades.</font>

187
00:15:29,320 --> 00:15:31,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So I wanted to think that</font>

188
00:15:31,610 --> 00:15:35,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you would carry on
my own will and power.</font>

189
00:15:37,240 --> 00:15:39,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That softness on my part...</font>

190
00:15:39,870 --> 00:15:43,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">created the conditions of that time
as well as now!</font>

191
00:15:45,210 --> 00:15:49,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you going to... kill me?</font>

192
00:15:51,840 --> 00:15:53,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Summoning Jutsu!</font>

193
00:15:58,270 --> 00:16:04,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if you can...
Sarutobi-sensei!</font>

194
00:16:22,160 --> 00:16:24,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kill him, Sarutobi!
Now's your only chance!</font>

195
00:16:45,150 --> 00:16:47,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sarutobi... You...</font>

196
00:16:48,690 --> 00:16:50,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I couldn't kill him...</font>

197
00:16:53,360 --> 00:16:57,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll bury you and correct
my old mistakes, now!</font>

198
00:17:01,160 --> 00:17:02,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I go!</font>

199
00:17:05,040 --> 00:17:07,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's too late!</font>

200
00:17:10,500 --> 00:17:12,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

201
00:17:14,300 --> 00:17:16,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way!
Why the Shadow Clone Jutsu?!</font>

202
00:17:16,840 --> 00:17:19,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To disperse the little Chakra
he has left...!</font>

203
00:17:21,060 --> 00:17:23,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've gotten old, after all...</font>

204
00:17:23,770 --> 00:17:27,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think you'd shorten your
own life span out of impatience...</font>

205
00:17:28,310 --> 00:17:29,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">D-Don't tell me, you...?!</font>

206
00:17:31,940 --> 00:17:36,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mi, I, Hitsuji, U, Inu, Ne, Tori, Uma, Mi...</font>

207
00:17:38,700 --> 00:17:39,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This order of Signs...</font>

208
00:17:40,700 --> 00:17:43,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I knew it, Sarutobi,
you are using that Jutsu!</font>

209
00:17:58,800 --> 00:18:02,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So this is the Grim Reaper
the Fourth Hokage was talking about,</font>

210
00:18:02,680 --> 00:18:07,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">which only the one who has signed
a contract with this Jutsu can see, eh?!</font>

211
00:18:07,770 --> 00:18:12,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whatever you do now, it's too late...
I've won.</font>

212
00:18:12,690 --> 00:18:14,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Leaf Village will crumble!</font>

213
00:18:14,990 --> 00:18:17,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Village Hidden in the Leaves
is the home where I live.</font>

214
00:18:17,990 --> 00:18:23,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Hokage exists as the pillar
to protect that home!</font>

215
00:18:24,540 --> 00:18:28,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Hokage is the one who inherits
and is entrusted the will of the Leaf.</font>

216
00:18:28,420 --> 00:18:30,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't go easily!</font>

217
00:18:32,380 --> 00:18:34,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Genjutsu! Infinite Darkness Jutsu!</font>

218
00:18:42,680 --> 00:18:44,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stupid nonsense...</font>

219
00:18:45,020 --> 00:18:47,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're merely a temporal head</font>

220
00:18:47,560 --> 00:18:50,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in the history of the organization
called the Leaf Village...</font>

221
00:18:58,360 --> 00:19:03,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even the face rock that is left
will eventually weather and decay.</font>

222
00:19:04,530 --> 00:19:09,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph... Leaf Village is
not just an organization to me!</font>

223
00:19:13,840 --> 00:19:15,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the Leaf Village,</font>

224
00:19:15,840 --> 00:19:19,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">every year many Shinobi
are born and raised...</font>

225
00:19:19,260 --> 00:19:23,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and live and fight...
and die to protect the village.</font>

226
00:19:49,750 --> 00:19:52,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The people of this village...</font>

227
00:19:52,290 --> 00:19:54,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even if they don't have blood ties...</font>

228
00:19:56,340 --> 00:19:59,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To me, they are precious...</font>

229
00:20:00,630 --> 00:20:01,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">precious...</font>

230
00:20:03,140 --> 00:20:04,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">family!</font>

231
00:20:13,560 --> 00:20:20,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I shall smash you, the pillar,
and destroy the Leaf home.</font>

232
00:20:21,400 --> 00:20:27,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph! Even if you kill me,
that pillar will not break!</font>

233
00:20:28,240 --> 00:20:33,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am the man who carried on the Leaf Will
of the First and Second Hokage...</font>

234
00:20:34,670 --> 00:20:36,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Third Hokage!</font>

235
00:20:38,000 --> 00:20:42,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter how much you target
this Village Hidden in the Leaves...</font>

236
00:20:42,470 --> 00:20:48,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A new Hokage will carry on my will,
shall become a pillar and defend the Leaf!</font>

237
00:20:49,720 --> 00:20:51,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right, Fourth Hokage?</font>

238
00:20:52,680 --> 00:20:58,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru! Now I will perform
an ace Jutsu that even you don't know!</font>

239
00:20:59,610 --> 00:21:03,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Behold! Sealing Jutsu!
Reaper Death Seal!</font>

240
00:21:05,260 --> 00:21:16,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">dare datte shippai wa surunda hazukashii koto janai</font></font></font></font>

241
00:21:05,260 --> 00:21:16,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">everyone makes mistakes it's nothing to be ashamed about</font></font></font></font>

242
00:21:16,050 --> 00:21:27,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kono kizu o muda ni shinai de waratte arukereba ii</font></font></font></font>

243
00:21:16,050 --> 00:21:27,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">don't let this scar be for naught walk with a smile</font></font></font></font>

244
00:21:37,330 --> 00:21:42,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">sou shizuka na kuuki suikomi hiroki sora ni kao age tobikomi</font></font></font></font>

245
00:21:37,330 --> 00:21:42,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">yes, breathe in the air and lift your face to the sky and jump</font></font></font></font>

246
00:21:42,930 --> 00:21:48,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">toki ni ame ga futtara hito yasumi jaa yukusaki wa kaze fuku mama ni</font></font></font></font>

247
00:21:42,930 --> 00:21:48,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">if it rains, take a break go where the wind takes you</font></font></font></font>

248
00:21:48,130 --> 00:21:53,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">takusan no matotteru koukai kono kizu o muda ni shicha shounai</font></font></font></font>

249
00:21:48,130 --> 00:21:53,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">so many regrets don't let this scar be for naught</font></font></font></font>

250
00:21:53,340 --> 00:21:56,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">ude ni kunshou kizami ikoukai shougai</font></font></font></font>

251
00:21:53,340 --> 00:21:56,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">let's go carve the in our chest</font></font></font></font>

252
00:21:56,970 --> 00:21:58,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">sou kokkara ga SHOW TIME</font></font></font></font>

253
00:21:56,970 --> 00:21:58,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">yes, it's show time, life begins now.</font></font></font></font>

254
00:21:58,480 --> 00:22:08,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">dare datte shippai wa surunda hazukashii koto janai</font></font></font></font>

255
00:21:58,480 --> 00:22:08,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">everyone makes mistakes It's nothing to be ashamed about</font></font></font></font>

256
00:22:08,950 --> 00:22:19,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kono kizu o muda ni shinai de waratte arukereba ii</font></font></font></font>

257
00:22:08,950 --> 00:22:19,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">don't let this scar be for naught walk with a smile</font></font></font></font>

258
00:22:19,500 --> 00:22:29,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kanashimi mo kaze ni kaete tsuyoku susunde ikereba ii</font></font></font></font>

259
00:22:19,500 --> 00:22:29,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">transform sadness into the wind and continue to forge on</font></font></font></font>

260
00:22:29,790 --> 00:22:35,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">tsuyoku susunde ikereba ii</font></font></font></font>

261
00:22:29,790 --> 00:22:35,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">forge on strong</font></font></font></font>

262
00:22:47,170 --> 00:22:49,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Every year in this village,</font>

263
00:22:49,550 --> 00:22:53,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Shinobi are born, nurtured,
and fight for the sake of the village.</font>

264
00:22:53,760 --> 00:22:58,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">They live to protect the village and
things that are precious to them.</font>

265
00:22:58,390 --> 00:23:04,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Even if they aren't related to me,
they are my precious family.</font>

266
00:23:05,190 --> 00:23:10,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I won't let you have your way
with my family!</font>

267
00:23:11,280 --> 00:23:13,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Forbidden Master Technique! Reaper Death Seal."</font>

